---
import CoordinatesDrill from '../../components/CoordinatesDrill.svelte';
import MateDrill from '../../components/MateDrill.svelte';
import TapAllDrill from '../../components/TapAllDrill.svelte';
import SafetyDrill from '../../components/SafetyDrill.svelte';
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { safetyDrill } from '../../lib/lessons';

const items = await safetyDrill();
---

<Base title="Daily drills" description="Two short chess drills to do every day: find the square, and is this move safe?">
  <div class="wrap wide">
    <h1>Daily drills</h1>
    <p>Short drills, a few minutes each, for the things that should become automatic. Your best scores stay on this device.</p>
    <section>
      <h2>Coordinates: find the square</h2>
      <p>Thirty seconds: find as many squares as you can, with no letters or numbers on the board.</p>
      <CoordinatesDrill client:load />
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2>Coordinates: name the square</h2>
      <p>The reverse: a square lights up, and you type its name. Thirty seconds.</p>
      <CoordinatesDrill client:load mode="name" />
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2>Pieces: where can it go?</h2>
      <p>A piece on a random square. Tap every square it can move to, then the next one. Five positions.</p>
      <TapAllDrill client:load kind="piece-squares" />
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2>Safety: is this move safe?</h2>
      <p>Before every move, ask: can they win something, or mate me, straight after it? Judge ten moves.</p>
      <SafetyDrill client:load {items} />
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2>Safety: spot the loose piece</h2>
      <p>Loose pieces drop off: a piece nothing defends is the first target for a fork. Tap every one, on both sides. Five positions.</p>
      <TapAllDrill client:load kind="loose-pieces" />
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2>Basic mates against the clock</h2>
      <p>Mate the lone king from a random start. Your score is the moves you have left over.</p>
      <MateDrill client:load />
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  section {
    margin-top: 40px;
  }
</style>
